      "description": "The jujutsu sorcerers, Utahime Iori and Mei Mei, are dispatched to an ominous manor where several people have gone missing. They infiltrate the manor and attempt to destroy the cursed spirit`s barrier, but suddenly the building starts to crumble."
    },
    {
      "episode": 2,
      "episodeNumber": 2,
      "title": "Hidden Inventory 2",
      "aired": "2023-07-13T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-07-13T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/14/1436815961b4393f2d_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/14/1436815961b4393f2d_w.webp",
      "description": "Gojo and Geto are assigned to the mission of escorting and erasing the young girl compatible with the Tengen- the Star Plasma Vessel. Amanai Riko is being targeted by the Curse User Group Q, and the religious cult the Star Religious Group."
    },
    {
      "episode": 3,
      "episodeNumber": 3,
      "title": "Hidden Inventory 3",
      "aired": "2023-07-20T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-07-20T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/14/14368161b2ee6a3695_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/14/14368161b2ee6a3695_w.webp",
      "description": "Gojo and Geto beat back the curse users after the bounty placed on Amanai`s head when her cell phone rings. A captured Kuroi is displayed on her phone. Gojo tries to bring Amanai back to Jujutsu High, but she insists on going to the negotiations herself."
    },
    {
      "episode": 4,
      "episodeNumber": 4,
      "title": "Hidden Inventory 4",
      "aired": "2023-07-27T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-07-27T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/14/14368163562efc5667_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/14/14368163562efc5667_w.webp",
      "description": "\"Let`s go home, Riko-chan.\" The moment Geto extends a hand to Amanai, the worst that could possibly happen does. Geto is left dumbstruck as Toji Fushiguro makes his appearance. Toji then declares that he killed Satoru Gojo."
    },
    {
      "episode": 5,
      "episodeNumber": 5,
      "title": "Premature Death",
