      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/175540339ad060cabd_w.webp",
      "description": "2018. After finishing a mission one day, Itadori decides to go to the movies, Kugisaki decides to go shopping, and Fushiguro tells them he`s going home. After parting ways Kugisaki is approached by a woman who suddenly asks if she was with Itadori-kun."
    },
    {
