      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/175540357eed228fb1_w.webp",
      "description": "The battle between Muta and Mahito continues and reaches its conclusion. Later, on October 31st, a veil is lowered over Shibuya and various jujutsu sorcerer teams assemble around the area."
    },
    {
      "episode": 8,
      "episodeNumber": 8,
      "title": "The Shibuya Incident",
