      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/175540375697f96702_w.webp",
      "description": "Team Mei Mei are reassigned to a veil that has been lowered over Meiji Shrine Station. The team splits up and Yuji encounters a grasshopper curse assigned to protecting the veil. Elsewhere Satoru Gojo encounters Jogo, Hanami, and Choso."
    },
    {
      "episode": 9,
      "episodeNumber": 9,
      "title": "Shibuya Incident - Gate, Open",
