      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17554039897a60db2d_w.webp",
      "description": "The battle between Satoru Gojo, Jogo, Hanami and Choso begins. Gojo informs Hanami that they will die first. Yuji encounters a woman who tells him that everyone was turned into monsters and boarded a train. As Gojo`s battle continues, the train arrives."
    },
    {
