      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/1755404155c7bef894_w.webp",
      "description": "Now that Satoru Gojo has been sealed, Mechamaru works with Team Mei Mei to inform them about what is going on and has them work on enacting his plan on what to do now."
    },
    {
