      "description": "Nanami, Fushiguro, and Ino meet up with Itadori, then Nanami issues new orders for the others to work together to lift the veil keeping sorcerers out."
    },
    {
      "episode": 12,
      "episodeNumber": 12,
      "title": "Dull Knife",
