      "description": "Yuji makes his way to Shibuya Station where he`s confronted by Choso. Choso unleashes his Convergence and the battle between him and Yuji commences."
    },
    {
      "episode": 14,
      "episodeNumber": 14,
      "title": "Fluctuations",
      "aired": "2023-10-26T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-10-26T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/175540493399c825f2_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/175540493399c825f2_w.webp",
      "description": "Mei Mei and Ui Ui fight the Special-Grade Disease Curse summoned by whatever is pretending to be Suguru Geto. Meanwhile, Nanami joins up with Maki and Naobito, but they encounter a cursed spirit with unknown powers."
    },
    {
      "episode": 15,
      "episodeNumber": 15,
      "title": "Fluctuations, Part 2",
      "aired": "2023-11-02T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-11-02T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/175540513c1fe86879_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/175540513c1fe86879_w.webp",
      "description": "Nanami, Maki, and Naobito are driven to the edge after the Special-Grade Cursed Spirit, Dagon, activates his Domain Expansion, Horizon of the Captivating Skandha. Fushiguro gives them a glimpse of a way to escape death, then Toji intrudes upon the fight."
    },
    {
      "episode": 16,
      "episodeNumber": 16,
      "title": "Thunderclap",
      "aired": "2023-11-09T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-11-09T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17554053a872633e15_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17554053a872633e15_w.webp",
      "description": "Sukuna refuses to heed Jogo`s advice after waking up, instead displaying his overwhelming strength against the Special-Grade Cursed Spirit, Jogo. Meanwhile, Fushiguro faces off against the rampant Toji with neither being aware of the other`s identity."
    },
    {
      "episode": 17,
      "episodeNumber": 17,
      "title": "Thunderclap, Part 2",
      "aired": "2023-11-16T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-11-16T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/1755405585aee13b4a_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/1755405585aee13b4a_w.webp",
      "description": "After being severely injured in his fight against Toji, Fushiguro suffers a surprise attack from Shigemo. On the verge of death, Fushiguro desperately heads toward Dougenzaka crossing and summons a certain Shikigami with his Ten Shadows Technique."
    },
    {
      "episode": 18,
      "episodeNumber": 18,
      "title": "Right and Wrong",
      "aired": "2023-11-23T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-11-23T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/175540573e79c38c7d_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/175540573e79c38c7d_w.webp",
      "description": "Itadori reawakens with grievous resolve as he bears witness to the aftermath Sukuna has wrought upon Shibuya. Meanwhile, Nanami continues to fight through packs of transfigured humans in an exhausted haze until Mahito appears before him."
    },
    {
      "episode": 19,
      "episodeNumber": 19,
      "title": "Right and Wrong, Part 2",
      "aired": "2023-11-30T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-11-30T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17554059560cae7750_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17554059560cae7750_w.webp",
      "description": "Itadori launches into a back-and-forth battle against Mahito, but he struggles against Mahito`s ploy of using average people against him. Meanwhile, Kugisaki encounters one of Mahito`s separated bodies as she returns to the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "episode": 20,
      "episodeNumber": 20,
      "title": "Right and Wrong, Part 3",
      "aired": "2023-12-07T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-12-07T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17554061aadda1fba0_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17554061aadda1fba0_w.webp",
      "description": "Itadori stands in a daze at the disaster before his eyes, his mind already well past its limit. As a curse, Mahito is elated at seeing his ideal sequence of events play out before him, and he prepares to further finish off Itadori."
    },
    {
      "episode": 21,
      "episodeNumber": 21,
      "title": "Metamorphosis",
      "aired": "2023-12-14T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-12-14T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17554063a2412d24c3_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17554063a2412d24c3_w.webp",
      "description": "After rescuing Itadori from his predicament, Todo bolsters his morale and encourages him to stand back up. As Mahito kicks things into higher gear, he begins using Soul Multiplicity and Body Repel to unleash omnidirectional attacks."
    },
    {
      "episode": 22,
      "episodeNumber": 22,
      "title": "Metamorphosis, Part 2",
      "aired": "2023-12-21T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-12-21T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/1755406503fdec80d5_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/1755406503fdec80d5_w.webp",
      "description": "The moment it appeared Itadori and Mahito`s battle to the death was resolved, the being wearing Geto`s body asked, \"Shall I save you, Mahito?\" Itadori immediately recognizes the man before him as the very same one who sealed away Gojo and leaps to attack."
    },
    {
      "episode": 23,
      "episodeNumber": 23,
      "title": "Shibuya Incident - Gate, Close",
      "aired": "2023-12-28T23:56:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-12-28T23:56:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17554067b3597b0e73_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17554067b3597b0e73_w.webp",
      "description": "Choso begins to realize the identity of the mastermind parasitizing Geto`s corpse as sorcerers gather for the final moments of the Shibuya Incident. The special-grade sorcerer, Yuki Tsukumo, comes to the rescue when they`re on the verge of death."
    }
